# OBJECTIVE

Enhance the Quantum Readiness workflow within QGuard Helix to guide organizations from being "Not Quantum Ready" to becoming fully eligible for the Quantum Trust Certification.

Current Pages:

• http://localhost:3000/dashboard/quantum-readiness
• http://localhost:3000/dashboard/quantum-certification

The goal is to transform the Quantum Readiness module from a reporting dashboard into an intelligent remediation platform that tells customers exactly what they need to do to eliminate their quantum vulnerabilities and qualify for certification.

----------------------------------------------------
CURRENT PROBLEM
----------------------------------------------------

Currently, users can scan their environments and receive a Quantum Readiness Assessment.

However, when the assessment determines that the organization is NOT Quantum Ready and therefore NOT eligible for the Quantum Trust Certification, the platform does not provide a comprehensive remediation roadmap.

Instead of simply displaying a failing score or certification status, QGuard Helix must become an AI-powered Quantum Migration Advisor that helps customers achieve certification.

